<title>JAPAN: Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.78.</title>
<headline>Japan 6-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.78.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>An auction of 1.5 trillion yen of six-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, on Monday produced the following results, the Ministry of Finance said:</p>
<p> Lowest price     99.78  Stop rate     0.43 pct</p>
<p> Average price    99.781  Average yield 0.427 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   4.43761  trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted Bids	1.49982  trillion yen</p>
<p> Bids accepted at lowest price 53.8216 pct</p>
<p> Issue date	 April 10, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity     October 13, 1997</p>
</text>
